sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as Seller
  participant A as NestJS API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant O as S3 storage
  S->>A: POST /invoices + Idempotency-Key
  A->>DB: advisory lock on the key (replay if it exists, 409 if the data differs)
  A->>DB: shared lock on the business day (DAY_CLOSED if closed)
  A->>DB: lock pieces ORDER BY id FOR UPDATE, mark them sold
  A->>DB: next number from a gap-free counter, inside the transaction
  A->>DB: lines split into base + 19% VAT, CUFE, audit entry, COMMIT
  A->>O: render the PDF with CUFE and QR after commit
  A-->>S: 201 FV-000001
